    "nickname": "5DN1L",
    "content": "Goal\n* I'm not sure whether the term \"standard English keyboard layout\" is appropriate because there isn't really a global standard. Besides, the keyboard consists of more than 26 keys. It may be clearer to call it the \"QWERTY keyboard letter layout\" instead.\n\n* The keyboard illustration is slightly too wide (e.g. in my usual browser window). Please reduce every key's width by 2 space characters.\n\n* Please change \"their sides intersect\" to \"they share a side\".\n\nCases\n* All cases that expect a single letter as the output currently appear as validators only. Some of them should be rearranged as tests.\n\n* Please reorder the cases (except the first pair of example cases) by increasing output length, grouping them in pairs with the same or similar output lengths. Of course, feel free to share if you have other considerations behind the current ordering.\n\nThanks.",
    "codingamerHandle": "bbb8f47ea4601179303c20acdbf5fb6c1904782",
    "onlineSince": 1778607591587,
    "avatar": 134264063920528,
    "elapsedTime": 5086966000
  },
