    "nickname": "N3l",
    "content": "Hi! Very good idea! I like it! :)\n\nAs it stands, it doesn't seem very suitable for the “shortest” mode, though. (Players could simply hardcode the 26 solutions)\nTo make this mode truly interesting, we could, for example, use a list of defective keys (that can't be used) as input instead of a standard full keyboard (just a thought).\n\nEDIT: I hadn't seen your solution, it's actually pretty elegant.\nI take back what I said; if we hard-coded it, the solution would be much longer :D",
    "codingamerHandle": "cbbb24d6a51ec60e0af86bdd22deebbd2052393",
    "onlineSince": 1778567327818,
