    "nickname": "5DN1L",
    "content": "Thank you. The revised pairing looks better, but the ordering could still use a few adjustments. In my suggestion below, I've tried to keep the changes minimal, while\n• arranging the cases roughly by output length, and\n• creating a more balanced distribution of\n(a) keys from each row (top vs middle vs bottom), and\n(b) leftmost/rightmost keys.\n\nUnder this suggestion,\n• 5 pairs remain unchanged.\n• 8 pairs are reordered.\n• Among those 8, some also have their test and validator swapped (marked with *).\n\nPair 1: A and K (unchanged)\nPair 2: N and W\nPair 3: Z and V (unchanged)\nPair 4: P and Y *\nPair 5: T and M *\nPair 6: X and Q *\nPair 7: O and U (unchanged)\nPair 8: R and S\nPair 9: E and L *\nPair 10: G and J (unchanged)\nPair 11: I and H (unchanged)\nPair 12: B and F\nPair 13: D and C *\n\nThanks again.",
